 enlightenment can only be obtained through the new training.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87491/5654637.jpg"},{"title":"Vanquished Queens: Airi's Supper Cheers","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11257","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21388","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30679","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45502","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[38]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87491","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[38]}],"link":"20790","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Vanquished Queens: Airi's Supper Cheers","synopsis":"At the Swamp Witch's Castle, a tired Airi apologizes, stating she had to catch an intruder in the Swamplands. Her clothes keep appearing and disappearing, despite her remarks that she is not fatigued. She proceeds to prepare the dinner, which Airi claims will offer full nourishment. After stirring the broth, she then searches for the gecko eyeballs, and blames Melona for misplacing them. While searching, she notices a live gecko moving across the floor, and she hurries to catch it, but it gets caught under the cabinet and Airi soon catches it. After adding the eyeballs to the broth, she begins to clean the castle, also blaming Melona for the mess and wondering where the other maids would ever arrive. She then tends to the artificial life-form the Swamp Witch created, and in the process, trips and spills the broth out of the pot, over her and the life-form. While in such a predicament, she offers the Swamp Witch to have a taste.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"At the Swamp Witch's Castle, a tired Airi apologizes, stating she had to catch an intruder in the Swamplands. Her clothes keep appearing and disappearing, despite her remarks that she is not fatigued. She proceeds to prepare the dinner, which Airi claims will offer full nourishment. After stirring the broth, she then searches for the gecko eyeballs, and blames Melona for misplacing them. While searching, she notices a live gecko moving across the floor, and she hurries to catch it, but it gets caught under the cabinet and Airi soon catches it. After adding the eyeballs to the broth, she begins to clean the castle, also blaming Melona for the mess and wondering where the other maids would ever arrive. She then tends to the artificial life-form the Swamp Witch created, and in the process, trips and spills the broth out of the pot, over her and the life-form. While in such a predicament, she offers the Swamp Witch to have a taste.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/87491/5813494.jpg"}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-30T07:57:40Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21388","mal:30679"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11257","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-2":"1-2"}},{"provider":"anidb","id":"12836","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"6080","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"6653","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"7442","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"8528","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"8528","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"9513","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"9513","scope":"S"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13855"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16363"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"18231"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21388","ranges":{"1-2":"1-2"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6704"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"7740"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"8456"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"98319"},{"provider":"mal","id":"16363"},{"provider":"mal","id":"18231"},{"provider":"mal","id":"30679","ranges":{"1-2":"1-2"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"6704"},{"provider":"mal","id":"7740"},{"provider":"mal","id":"8456"},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87491","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1-2":"37-38"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"aniz